<title>USA: USDA releases $50 million more in GSM-102 for Pakistan.</title>
<headline>USDA releases $50 million more in GSM-102 for Pakistan.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline to $50 million from $50.)</p>
<p>U.S. Agriculture Department said Friday it released an additional $50 million in short-term GSM-102 export credit guarantees to Pakistan for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>With the step, Pakistan received $124 million of the $250 million earmarked for it this fiscal year.</p>
</text>
